019s technological habits, and use that to form a profile of the user of some sort. I used a packet-monitoring service to listen in on third-party applications and wrote a script to filter out relevant pieces of data that were being sent back to an application\u2019s server. The findings of this study concluded that third-party iOS applications have unmonitored power to access pieces of information like contacts, location, and emails.","topics":[],"score":179921,"global_rank":410887},{"name":"erinsteiner-NOAA/fisheryconfidentiality","owner":"erinsteiner-NOAA","html_url":"https://github.com/erinsteiner-NOAA/fisheryconfidentiality","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Other","description":"Fledgling project to build tools to work with confidential fisheries data","topics":[],"score":179921,"global_rank":410888},{"name":"chiarng/extint_jenkins_demo","owner":"chiarng","html_url":"https://github.com/chiarng/extint_jenkins_demo","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Other","description":"App for demoing Jenkins Plugin for ServiceNow CI/CD","topics":[],"score":179921,"global_rank":410889},{"name":"dblitt/ShulkerStore","owner":"dblitt","html_url":"https://github.com/dblitt/ShulkerStore","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Other","description":null,"topics":[],"score":179921,"global_rank":410890},{"name":"stevengum/arm-templates-for-samples","owner":"stevengum","html_url":"https://github.com/stevengum/arm-templates-for-samples","stars":0,"forks":1,"watchers":0,"issues":0,"language":"Other","description":"For soliciting feedback on ARM templates","topics":[],"score":179918,"global_rank":410891},{"name":"sparkyfen/7chanCurl","owner":"sparkyfen","html_url":"https://github.com/sparkyfen/7chanCurl","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"PHP","description":"7chan Image Downloader","topics":[],"score":179916,"global_rank":410892},{"name":"brepowell/reproducible-ml-scipy-2025","owner":"brepowell","html_url":"h